Bundled extraction tools
========================

Gosh AppImage Manager packages unsquashfs, 7zz, and dwarfsextract so AppImage
metadata can be inspected without executing the candidate.

Corresponding source is downloaded by the Flatpak manifest (pinned SHA-256)
and installed to /app/share/gosh-appimage-manager/corresponding-source/.
License texts are installed to /app/share/gosh-appimage-manager/licenses/.

- squashfs-tools 4.6.1, GPL-2.0-or-later
- 7-Zip 26.00, GNU LGPL with unRAR restriction (see License.txt)
- dwarfs 0.15.3, GPL-3.0-or-later
